{"call_id": "bb25941054874517bed5e799302d9631", "success": true, "result_file": "/data/nly/Agent-Aware-Trajectory-Level-Query/benchmark/fullbench/runs/fad/PATENTS/query2/full-01/results/bb25941054874517bed5e799302d9631.json", "row_count": null, "preview": "{\"submitted\": true, \"answer\": \"TASK: CPC technology areas in Germany with the highest exponential moving average (smoothing factor 0.1) of yearly patent filings, for patents granted in the second half of 2019 (July 1 – December 31, 2019), at CPC level 4.\\n\\nMETHOD:\\n- Selected patents whose publication number is German (DE-...) and whose grant date falls in H2 2019: 34 patents (out of 68 DE patents granted in 2019; the other 34 were granted Jan–Jun 2019).\\n- Extracted each patent's distinct CPC codes and mapped them to the level-4 CPC group (class, 3-character symbol, per cpc_definition where level = 4, e.g. \\\"A01\\\").\\n- Counted filings per level-4 group per filing year and computed the EMA over consecutive years (alpha = 0.1, recursive EMA: ema_t = 0.1*count_t + 0.9*ema_{t-1}, gap years count as 0).\\n- The \\\"best year\\\" for each group is the year with the highest EMA value; groups are ranked by that peak EMA.\\n\\nRESULT — top CPC technology areas (level 4) by peak EMA of yearly filings:\\n\\n1. A61 — MEDICAL OR VETERINARY SCIENCE; HYGIENE — best year: 2016 (peak EMA = 3.0; filings: 2016=3)\\n2. H04 — ELECTRIC COMMUNICATION TECHNIQUE — best year: 2015 (peak EMA = 2.0; filings: 2015=2)\\n\\nAll other level-4 groups have a peak EMA of 1.0 (single-filing years dominate). Full list of remaining groups with their best year:\\n- B41 — PRINTING; LINING MACHINES; TYPEWRITERS; STAMPS — best year 2007\\n- F02 — COMBUSTION ENGINES; HOT-GAS OR COMBUSTION-PRODUCT ENGINE PLANTS — best year 2010\\n- F04 — POSITIVE-DISPLACEMENT MACHINES FOR LIQUIDS; PUMPS FOR LIQUIDS OR ELASTIC FLUIDS — best year 2014\\n- G01 — MEASURING; TESTING — best year 2008\\n- B23 — MACHINE TOOLS; METAL-WORKING NOT OTHERWISE PROVIDED FOR — best year 2015\\n- B63 — SHIPS OR OTHER WATERBORNE VESSELS; RELATED EQUIPMENT — best year 2014\\n- Y02 — TECHNOLOGIES OR APPLICATIONS FOR MITIGATION OR ADAPTATION AGAINST CLIMATE CHANGE — best year 2013\\n- B66 — HOISTING; LIFTING; HAULING — best year 2016\\n- E02 — HYDRAULIC ENGINEERING; FOUNDATIONS; SOIL SHIFTING — best year 2012\\n- B60 — VEHICLES IN GENERAL — best year 2009\\n- F16 — ENGINEERING ELEMENTS AND UNITS; GENERAL MEASURES FOR PRODUCING AND MAINTAINING EFFECTIVE FUNCTIONING OF MACHINES OR INSTALLATIONS; THERMAL INSULATION IN GENERAL — best year 2009\\n- A47 — FURNITURE; DOMESTIC ARTICLES OR APPLIANCES; COFFEE MILLS; SPICE MILLS; SUCTION CLEANERS IN GENERAL — best year 2015\\n- A21 — BAKING; EDIBLE DOUGHS — best year 2015\\n- A43 — FOOTWEAR — best year 2016\\n- F24 — HEATING; RANGES; VENTILATING — best year 2018\\n- F23 — COMBUSTION APPARATUS; COMBUSTION PROCESSES — best year 2018\\n- H01 — ELECTRIC ELEMENTS — best year 2008\\n- F05 — INDEXING SCHEMES RELATING TO ENGINES OR PUMPS IN VARIOUS SUBCLASSES OF CLASSES F01-F04 — best year 2018\\n- F01 — MACHINES OR ENGINES IN GENERAL; ENGINE PLANTS IN GENERAL; STEAM ENGINES — best year 2018\\n- B64 — AIRCRAFT; AVIATION; COSMONAUTICS — best year 2018\\n- B62 — LAND VEHICLES FOR TRAVELLING OTHERWISE THAN ON RAILS — best year 2010\\n- C04 — CEMENTS; CONCRETE; ARTIFICIAL STONE; CERAMICS; REFRACTORIES — best year 2015\\n- C09 — DYES; PAINTS; POLISHES; NATURAL RESINS; ADHESIVES; COMPOSITIONS NOT OTHERWISE PROVIDED FOR; APPLICATIONS OF MATERIALS NOT OTHERWISE PROVIDED FOR — best year 2015\\n- B29 — WORKING OF PLASTICS; WORKING OF SUBSTANCES IN A PLASTIC STATE IN GENERAL — best year 2007\\n- G02 — OPTICS — best year 2016\\n- G07 — CHECKING-DEVICES — best year 2012\\n- Y10 — TECHNICAL SUBJECTS COVERED BY FORMER USPC — best year 2012\\n- E05 — LOCKS; KEYS; WINDOW OR DOOR FITTINGS; SAFES — best year 2012\\n- H02 — GENERATION; CONVERSION OR DISTRIBUTION OF ELECTRIC POWER — best year 2009\\n- H03 — ELECTRONIC CIRCUITRY — best year 2015\\n- F42 — AMMUNITION; BLASTING — best year 2012\\n- F41 — WEAPONS — best year 2012\\n- G08 — SIGNALLING — best year 2017\\n\\nANSWER SUMMARY: The German (DE) patents granted in the second half of 2019 show the highest EMA (alpha = 0.1) of yearly filings in CPC level-4 group A61 \\\"MEDICAL OR VETERINARY SCIENCE; HYGIENE\\\" (best year 2016, peak EMA 3.0), followed by H04 \\\"ELECTRIC COMMUNICATION TECHNIQUE\\\" (best year 2015, peak EMA 2.0). All remaining level-4 groups peak at an EMA of 1.0.\\n\"}", "truncated": false}
